+-## Mandatory first gates
++## First gates
+ 
+-1. Compile with pinned Solidity 0.8.28 using the optimizer settings in `hardhat.config.js`.
+-2. Measure deployed runtime and creation bytecode for every active contract.
+-3. Reject Governance Staking or Revenue Strategy if deployed runtime exceeds 23,500 bytes without explicit review; absolute EIP-170 limit is 24,576 bytes.
+-4. Run all executable tests and add regression tests for the audit focus areas.
+-5. Do not deploy from this package before all failures are resolved.
