+-- Dynamic Revenue Staking withdrawal fee and gross-up rounding
+-- Vault strategy proposal, retirement, and seven-day migration
+-- cyGOV checkpoint behavior on mint, burn, and transfer
+-- Mint-controller reservation lifecycle and allocation accounting
+-- Proposal-sync signature replay, caller binding, nonce semantics, and EIP-712 domain
+-- Cross-contract reentrancy between vault, strategy, converter, staking, and distributor
