+# Auditor Test Plan V18.8
+
+## Governance Token reservation replacement
+
+- Replace zero→nonzero, nonzero→larger, nonzero→smaller, and nonzero→zero.
+- Replacement that does not fit must revert with the old reservation unchanged.
+- Confirm global and per-minter reservation totals exactly match reservation storage.
+- Confirm Governance Token owner cannot directly cancel a protected Yield Staking reservation.
+- Confirm the reservation-owning Yield Staking minter can replace or release it.
+- Attempt allocation reductions to one unit below and exactly at minted+reserved usage.
+- Revoke minter with active reservation and document intended emergency behavior.
+
+## cyGOV Yield Staking rate/backing
+
+- Set max rate with held-only, reserve-only, and mixed backing.
+- Boundary at exactly 30× rate and one unit short.
+- Consume held inventory first, then reservation.
+- Start with held-only backing, consume inventory, and prove the first automatic reserve is protected from token-owner cancellation.
+- Confirm accrued liabilities reduce `freeHeldCyGov` immediately.
+- Run long elapsed checkpoints where newly unlocked capacity can and cannot replenish reserve.
+- Lower rate and prove exact excess reservation release after 14 days.
+- Raise rate and prove atomic extra reservation at execution.
+- Change Governance Token allocation around active reservation boundaries.
+
+## Staking/rewards
+
+- First staker, late staker, partial withdrawal, withdraw all, claim before/after share changes.
+- Target yield below cap, exactly at cap, and above cap with multiple stake sizes.
+- Reward rounding over many small checkpoints and full supply extinction.
+- Direct cyGOV donations while liabilities exist.
+- Initial inventory mint before and after reward mints; enforce unused original 15B limit.
+
+## Decay
+
+- Rates 0, 1, 3, and 10.
+- Partial day, exact day, multiple days, and enough elapsed days to reach 100%.
+- Prove linear rather than compounded calculation.
+- Deposit/withdraw/claim/checkpoint triggers and no per-day loop.
+- Verify Treasury receipt equals accounted-principal reduction.
+- Old-epoch reward claims after complete principal extinction.
+
+## Revenue benchmark fees
+
+- No active stake: all reward to Treasury, no admin amount.
+- Active-only benchmark, active+queued benchmark, represented amount above gross, and zero excess.
+- Excess split at rounding boundaries; prove 4,000/1,000 bps and conservation.
+- Verify the 40% excess portion reaches Treasury.
+- Verify the 10% excess portion reaches only the current Revenue Staking `admin` address, including after an admin-role transfer.
+- Verify no separate admin-fee-recipient setting exists.
+
+## Regression
+
+Run all V18.7 Revenue Vault/Strategy/Converter/Distributor and Governance Staking/Boost/Mint Controller tests. Compile and report exact runtime sizes for every deployable.
